Does retention hold over a genuinely long life?

480000 steps: 20 full rotations through ['keyed', 'open', 'trap']
phases of 8000, cycle of 24000, measured once per cycle
so every checkpoint is taken at the SAME point in the rotation.

The previous attempt checkpointed every 25,000 steps against a 30,000-step
cycle. The aliasing was eight times the trend and the run was void.

